cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Genesis Governance OS
message: >-
  If you use this standard, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dechanon
    given-names: Bunyawat
    alias: ElmatadorZ
repository-code: 'https://github.com/ElmatadorZ/genesis-governance-os'
abstract: >-
  An open standard for multi-agent systems that stay legible, safe, and
  accountable — in any language, on any model. Comprises four specifications:
  GTS-1 (task state), GPS-2 (permission), GOP-3 (orchestration), and GOS-0
  (governance constitution).
keywords:
  - multi-agent-systems
  - ai-governance
  - ai-safety
  - open-standard
  - agent-orchestration
license-url: 'https://github.com/ElmatadorZ/genesis-governance-os/blob/main/LICENSE.md'
version: '2.0'
